{"articleNo":"306242","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=306242&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교내행사] 제 7회 「이정연장학금」 수여식 개최 (컴퓨터소프트웨어공학과)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2021.04.02","hit":"9084","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img width=\"1075\" height=\"508\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"width: 784px; height: 362px; clear: none; float: none;\" src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmEYHoQFkg3A8gewApoGoC8ASBjALQBEBpAUQAcBHAMQCMScA6AKwoHMg%20\"></p><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp; 벚꽃이 만개했던 지난달 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">30</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">컴퓨터소프트웨어공학과는 제 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">7</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">회 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">「</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이정연장학금</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">」 </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">수여식을 개최하였다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">수여식은&nbsp;이정연 학생의 부모 이용석</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">‧</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이성미님을 비롯해 컴퓨터소프트웨어공학과 교수 및 학생들</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">졸업생이 참석하여 뜻깊은 시간으로 채워졌다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">  </span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp; 컴퓨터소프트웨어공학과에 입학한 이정연 학생은&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2016</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">불의의 사고로 사랑하는 가족과 친구들의 곁을 떠났다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">고인의 꿈과 따뜻한 마음이 후배들에게도 계속 이어지길 바라신 이정연 학생의 부모님은 우수인재 양성을 위한 장학기금으로 대학에 발전기금 총 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">억원을 전달했다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">대학은 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">‘</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이정연 장학금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">’ </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이라는 명칭으로 매년 우수한 학생을 선정해 장학금을 지급하고 있다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">올해는 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">명이 장학금 수여자로 선정되었으며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, 2016</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">년부터 현재까지 총 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">30</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">명의 학생들에게 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1,500</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">만 원의 장학금이 전달되었다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">  </span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp; 부모님과 컴퓨터소프트웨어공학과는 매년 그를 그리며 생각하는 자리를 가지고 있다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">올해 수여식에서는 졸업하여 사회인이 된 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2016</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">회 장학생이 참석하여 부모님께 감사의 편지를 전달하였고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, 2021</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">년 선발된 장학생들도 장학금의 의미를 마음에 새기고 더욱 성장해 나갈 것을 다짐하였다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">컴퓨터소프트웨어공학과는 앞으로도 우수 학생들을 선발하여 이정연 학생의 뜻을 이어 갈 예정이다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">※ 아래는 디지털관 앞 이정연학생을 기리기 위한 나무 앞에서.</span><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><img width=\"816\" height=\"601\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"width: 695px; height: 490px; clear: none; float: none;\" src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmEYHoQFkhFAogKQNYGUCeA3ACgWwFlsArAIQGdsA5AMQAdCAVAOhPoHMg%20\"></p><p><br></p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><p><br></p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><p><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><br></p></span></span><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
